  "description": "A small, batteries-included static site generator for .NET. Give it Markdown and site settings, and it renders a complete site: listing pages, an archive, tags, client-side search, per-post Open Graph images, SEO metadata, an RSS feed, a sitemap, favicons, and a PWA manifest. Site-specific behavior is injected through SiteCustomization.",
